OL,3,GNEWSAMan who nearly died during liver
OL,4,Asurgery at ARI says mistakes were made
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who almost died during liver
OL,7,Fsurgery at Aberdeen Royal Infirmary
OL,8,F(ARI) has told BBC Scotland news he
OL,9,Fbelieves mistakes were made during his
OL,10,Foperation.
OL,12,FDerek Appleton from Stockport was
OL,13,Fliving in Orkney when he underwent
OL,14,Fsurgery to remove 60% of his liver
OL,15,Fafter being diagnosed with stage four
OL,16,Fcancer.
OL,18,FThe 60-year-old lost 11 litres of blood
OL,19,Fand went into cardiac arrest, but says
OL,20,Fhe has never been given a proper
OL,21,Fexplanation for what happened.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,423,420,260,160,0,100
